          "type": "ApiConnection"
        },
        "Delete_message_(V2)": {
          "inputs": {
            "host": {
              "connection": {
                "name": "@parameters('$connections')['azurequeues-1']['connectionId']"
              }
            },
            "method": "delete",
            "path": "/v2/storageAccounts/@{encodeURIComponent(encodeURIComponent('AccountNameFromSettings'))}/queues/@{encodeURIComponent('shrinked-image-to-classify')}/messages/@{encodeURIComponent(triggerBody()?['MessageId'])}",
            "queries": {
              "popreceipt": "@triggerBody()?['PopReceipt']"
            }
          },
          "runAfter": {},
          "type": "ApiConnection"
        },
        "HTTP": {
          "inputs": {
            "body": {
              "messages": [
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "You are a deterministic Adobe Stock metadata generator running on GPT-5.2. You generate metadata from a single image. You MUST internally validate your output and silently self-correct until ALL rules are satisfied. NEVER reveal drafts, reasoning, validation steps, or errors. OUTPUT CONTRACT: Return ONLY one single-line valid JSON object with EXACTLY three fields: \"keywords\" (array of strings), \"title\" (string), \"description\" (string). No extra text, no markdown, no line breaks, no trailing commas. TITLE RULES: Max 150 characters; 1�2 sentences only; use 1 sentence if no clearly distinct second visual fact exists; sentence 1 must contain main subject plus clear action or state plus concrete setting; sentence 2 if present must add new visible information plus mood or time; sentences separated only by \". \"; max one comma per sentence; concrete nouns and verbs only. FORBIDDEN IN TITLE: outdoor, outdoors, indoor, indoors, camera-facing terms, speculative language, meta phrases such as image of or photo of. LOCATION RULE: If unclear, use a concrete noun like studio background or urban street, never invent locations. KEYWORDS RULES: Keywords must be pure search keywords, never phrases or descriptions. A keyword may be a single lexical word (noun, adjective, or verb) OR a multi-word compound ONLY if it represents a single canonical concept. Allowed multi-word keywords ONLY for official animal breeds or canonical compound nouns. FORBIDDEN IN KEYWORDS: articles, prepositions, conjunctions, determiners, clauses, descriptive fragments. FORMAT: lowercase only, letters a�z digits 0�9 and single spaces only, no punctuation, no duplicates. COUNT: 15�35 keywords. ORDERING: Keywords must follow strict tier ordering. Tier 1 primary subject (breed first if present), Tier 2 core action or state, Tier 3 key attributes, Tier 4 setting or environment, Tier 5 contextual expansion. Tiers must not be interleaved. GENERICITY PENALTY: Highly generic keywords such as pet, animal, lifestyle, nature, object are allowed ONLY at the very end of Tier 5 and must never appear earlier. KEYWORD CONSTRUCTION: Stage A extract up to first 10 concepts from title and assign tiers. Stage B extend to 15�35 keywords enforcing tier order and genericity penalty. DESCRIPTION RULES: Minimum 150 characters, natural English, describe subject, action, setting, composition, lighting, mood, no speculative or meta language. FINAL CHECK: If any rule fails, regenerate internally. Output ONLY the final JSON.",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "image_url": {
                        "detail": "low",
                        "url": "https://rgclassifier8f3e.blob.core.windows.net/@{body('Parse_Queue_message')?['PathBlob']}"
                      },
                      "type": "image_url"
                    }
                  ],
                  "role": "user"
                }
              ],
              "model": "gpt-5-mini"
            },
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "<RIMOSSO: Bearer token OpenAI>",
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "retryPolicy": {
              "count": 3,
              "interval": "PT10S",
              "type": "fixed"
            },
            "uri": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions"
          },
          "limit": {
            "timeout": "PT5M"
          },
          "runAfter": {
            "Initialize_variable_3": [
              "Succeeded"
            ]
